  - line: 12
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_focus: Six months into First Tongue practice, the Sage learns Deep Grammar—structural harmonic frequencies (\"eeeee\", \"iiiii\", \"aaaaa\") that enable consciousness-reality collaboration; together they establish the four-stage teaching curriculum (Foundation, Development, Synthesis, Collaboration)."
